{"schema_version":2,"train_id":"yuwen-mowen-train-63","wave_id":"yuwen-mowen-train-63-wave-01","stage":"private_quality_audit","status":"complete","source_artifact":{"workflow":"Release train orchestrator","run_id":30562590785,"artifact_id":8767523023,"artifact_name":"relation-audit-evidence","artifact_file":"yuwen_mowen.json","digest":"sha256:c5397147b048764b76d16b4d52e980fc51926fec13417495a79e2a834cd799fe","head_sha":"39a116c5ba1e1c99b7770803d48317cb85bc7f8a"},"decisions":[{"packet_id":"yuwen-mowen-train63-packet-01","candidate":"_phase4_proofread/CANDIDATE_YUWEN_MOWEN_SCENES5585_4_5611_8_2026-07-31.json","scene_groups":["5585_4","5586_3","5586_5","5603_1","5610_2","5611_8"],"status":"audited","fixes":[{"key":"5586_3_Dlgs_Index5_Text","before":"17005 - 欧陽雪 $@$粗酒を数杯差し上げただけで、礼にもなりません。先輩のお気に召したなら何よりです。","after":"17005 - 欧陽雪 $@$粗酒を数杯お出ししただけで、おもてなしにもなりません。先輩のお気に召したなら何よりです。","reason":"meaning/voice: 洪飛から先日の款待を礼言された欧陽雪が、粗酒だけでは十分なもてなしにならないと謙遜する句。現訳の「礼にもなりません」は返礼・謝礼の意味へ寄り、場面上の款待をずらすため、「お出しした／おもてなし」に戻す。"},{"key":"5603_1_Dlgs_Index11_Text","before":"5029 - 莫棄 $@$小逸、道中であの妖女と仲間として過ごし、仲間の情が湧いたのは分かる。だが、それであいつが邪教の人間だってことを忘れるな！","after":"5029 - 莫棄 $@$小逸、道中を共にして、あの妖女に仲間の情が湧いたのは分かる。だが、それであいつが邪教の人間だってことを忘れるな！","reason":"voice: 玄火教への警戒を急いで念押しする場面。現訳は「仲間として過ごし、仲間の情」と同語を重ねて説明調になり、莫棄の切迫した忠告を鈍らせる。意味・疑念の強度を変えず、前半だけを自然な短句へ直す。"}],"keeps":["5585_4_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index6_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index6_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5586_3_Dlgs_Index8_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index6_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index6_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index7_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index8_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index10_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index12_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index13_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index14_Text","5610_2_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5610_2_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5610_2_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5611_8_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5611_8_Dlgs_Index2_Text"],"allusion_review_candidates":["自作聪明","合眼缘","信誓旦旦","拼死反扑"],"allusion_review_resolved":[{"key":"5586_5_Dlgs_Index3_Text","decision":"定着した評価成語","note":"「自作聪明」は自分だけ賢いつもりで余計な推測をする意の定着成語。洪飛の悪態混じりの親しみとして、現訳「知った顔をしおって」が像と軽い叱責を保つ。"},{"key":"5586_3_Dlgs_Index4_Text","decision":"通常の口語的評価表現","note":"「合眼缘」は見た目や気性が気に入り縁を感じる口語表現で、特定典籍の引用ではない。現訳「確かに気に入った」が洪飛の飄逸な好意を自然に保つ。"},{"key":"5603_1_Dlgs_Index12_Text","decision":"特定典籍由来だが現代語として定着した成語","note":"「信誓旦旦」は『詩経』衛風・氓に由来するが、この場面では莫棄が玄火教の強い誓約を疑う通常成語として使う。現訳「あれほど誓っていた」は引用調へ上げず、疑念の機能を保つ。"},{"key":"5603_1_Dlgs_Index4_Text","decision":"通常の戦闘表現","note":"「拼死反扑」は死に物狂いの反撃を表す通常の戦闘表現で、特定典故ではない。現訳「死に物狂いで反撃してきた」が強度と状況を保つ。"}],"fact_doubts":[{"scope":"spy_report_and_avoidance_plan","keys":["5585_4_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5585_4_Dlgs_Index5_Text"],"note":"天龍幇が避戦を企てるという情報は六扇門の密偵からの報告で、莫問も「似乎」と伝える。曹煜天の具体的な逃走計画や確定した意図へ強めない。"},{"scope":"hongfei_hidden_purpose","keys":["5586_5_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5586_5_Dlgs_Index6_Text"],"note":"洪飛は包囲参加を問われても通りすがりと言い張り、目撃を口止めして警告だけを残す。実際の目的、任務、各派との連携を確定しない。"},{"scope":"xuanhuo_involvement_inference","keys":["5603_1_Dlgs_Index8_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index9_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index10_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index11_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index12_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index13_Text"],"note":"包囲時刻の漏洩と玄火教関与は掌門たち・莫棄の推測。玄火教の不在は疑念の根拠だが、内通、裏切り、瑶姫個人の関与や意図を客観事実へしない。"},{"scope":"east_path_battle_status","keys":["5603_1_Dlgs_Index2_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index3_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index4_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index5_Text","5603_1_Dlgs_Index14_Text","5610_2_Dlgs_Index0_Text","5610_2_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5610_2_Dlgs_Index2_Text"],"note":"東側小道の守備、残党の反撃、残敵の脅威低下、山頂支援は斬無刑・莫棄の報告と判断。残党全滅や山頂の戦況を先取りして確定しない。"},{"scope":"mourning_context_at_5611_8","keys":["5611_8_Dlgs_Index1_Text","5611_8_Dlgs_Index2_Text"],"note":"宇文逸は欧陽雪へ死別を慰めるが、関係行だけでは対象者、死因、直前戦闘の全経緯を確定できない。言いさしを保ち、山頂の異変へ急ぐ行動だけを示す。"}],"reading_attestation":{"contract_id":"quality-audit-source-feedback-v1","manifest_digest":"sha256:9ac15357b8c5a1b594a71e9920d2022c55983f4883db7c7690aeed0083cc0d65","primary_evidence_reviewed":true,"doubt_gates_completed_before_reference_crosscheck":true,"documents":[{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/SKILL.md","digest":"sha256:46ad6f5075579dd27ac4839147853798da3b95f4f094f9bb30d7c79f940852cd","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/03_style_guide.md","digest":"sha256:3d2a2a1ebdceb2b45c4f31d25abe1daffbb4eab544fb7e6b4c3cbc9de03604de","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/04_persona.md","digest":"sha256:77aea1ef8798cf537fc03e03e5ab32749f1edfb747c6caee68adec6acaab1e45","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/05_terminology.md","digest":"sha256:50ec5fcaa928bb62fc82d2c9ef4e0a20ae32585bef5bc4edf79a28c88e50e900","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/06_qa.md","digest":"sha256:87ec74a6401d10a6b4c85c8230d9cdc1ef8bff326d93f8b86f9d4e8cb0d188d6","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/08_pair_reaudit.md","digest":"sha256:a1b993d29e34efe753d13cce59796056b521971871f7f6612a5b0465992b8917","status":"reviewed"},{"path":".agents/skills/zhja-game-translation-codex/references/10_register_axes.md","digest":"sha256:3d4e6261474aea14539876fcb1d17a88add21513b77c7f1c77b42951a034b0ef","status":"reviewed"},{"path":"_phase4_proofread/RUNBOOK_人物ペア再監査.md","digest":"sha256:363b04582c4a8798fe0f2db1cd51fba7ebefa9d1a7e3a6208c28f1eb65a250ab","status":"revi